WEBVTT

00:20:28.496 --> 00:20:33.538
So what at first was kind of just like
charming and even funny sign is now

00:20:33.663 --> 00:20:37.288
a real open question, right? Like, will
that theater ever actually reopen?

00:20:38.079 --> 00:20:39.663
And I hope they do. I hope they do,

00:20:39.663 --> 00:20:43.663
because I think that there's something
really powerful about seeing movies in

00:20:43.663 --> 00:20:45.621
person. That classic experience,

00:20:45.954 --> 00:20:48.621
which you describe so beautifully in
your talk from a few years ago.

00:20:48.871 --> 00:20:51.496
Here's a clip of that this weekend.

00:20:52.163 --> 00:20:55.621
Tens of millions of people in the United
States and tens of millions of.

00:20:55.704 --> 00:21:00.871
All around the world, in Columbus, Georgia
, in Cardiff, Wales, in Chongqing,